#
# etc/parse.eng
# 
# <command>:<function name>:<short help string>:<group>
#
# Groups:
# T - Texts / articles and mail
# C - Conferences
# F - Files
# M - Messaging and communication
# P - Personal settings
# I - Information and listings
# X - Games and external services
# A - Administration / Sysop
# O - Other / miscellaneous
# Y - Synonyms and aliases
#
Add permissions:cmd_add_rights:Add permissions for user in current conference:C
(Display article) again:cmd_display_last:Redisplay last article read:T
(Define) alias:cmd_alias:Defines an alias for a command:P
(Read) all (texts):cmd_readall:Displays all your unread articles:T
Answer:cmd_answermsg:Answer a say-message:M
Back:cmd_back_text:Unreads latest read <number of articles> articles:T
Block:cmd_block_user:Edit your list of blocked users:P
Clear:cmd_cls:Clear screen:O
Cls:cmd_cls:Same as Clear (clear screen):Y
Change character set:cmd_change_charset:Change the character set used by your terminal:P
Change loginscript:cmd_mod_login:Change commands executed at login:P
Change note:cmd_mod_note:Change your "note":P
Change password:cmd_change_passwd:Change your password:P
Change conference:cmd_mod_conf:Edit conference settings:C
#Change conferencedescription:cmd_change_cdesc:Change conference description:C
#Change conferencename:cmd_change_cname:Edit conference settings:C
Change replyconference:cmd_change_comc:Change reply conference:C
Change personal (information):cmd_mod_pinfo:Change personal information:P
Change plan:cmd_mod_sig:Change your plan file:P
Change rows:cmd_mod_numlines:Set number of rows:Y
Change screen (length):cmd_mod_numlines:Change number of screen rows:P
Change signature:cmd_mod_sig:Change your signature:P
Change timeout:cmd_mod_timeout:Change timeout period:P
Create conference:cmd_create_conf:Create a new conference:C
Delete article:cmd_delete_text:Delete a specific article:T
Delete conference:cmd_delete_conf:Deletes a conference:C
Delete file:cmd_unlink:Deletes a file from current conference:F
Describe (file):cmd_describe:Describe a file in current conference:F
Display (article):cmd_read_text:Displays a specific article:T
Display followed-up:cmd_display_commented:Displays commented article:T
Download (file):cmd_download:Download a file from current conference:F
Enter (article):cmd_post_text:Same as 'Write (article)':Y
Find:cmd_grep:Search for a string in conference:T
Footnote:cmd_footnote:Adds a footnote to a text:T
Follow-up:cmd_comment:Post a follow-up to an article:T
From:cmd_from:Show where you are from:P
Get (QWK-packet):cmd_sendbatch:Send all your unread texts in QWK-format:T
Globalfind:cmd_global_grep:Search for a string among all conferences:T
Goto (conference):cmd_change_conf:Goto another conference:C
Help:cmd_long_help:Display help about a specific command:I
High (priority) (conference):cmd_prio:Give high priority to conference:C
I:cmd_I:Tell others how you are:M
(Show) information:cmd_info:Display information about the system:I
Last (logged in):cmd_list_last:Show last logged in users:I
List commands:cmd_help:List all commands:I
List conferences:cmd_list_confs:List all conferences:C
List files:cmd_list_files:List all files in current conference:F
List flags:cmd_list_flags:List all flags:P
List news:cmd_list_news:Count new articles in all conferences:T
List permissions:cmd_list_rights:Show permissions for users in conference:C
List subjects:cmd_list_subj:List subjects in current conference:T
List subscribers:cmd_list_member:List all subscribers to a conference:C
List tells:cmd_list_says:List received tell-messages:M
List users:cmd_list_users:List all users:I
List yells:cmd_list_yells:List received yell and I-messages:M
Logout:cmd_end_session:End session:O
Low (priority) (conference):cmd_deprio:Give low priority to conference:C
Mail:cmd_mail:Send mail:T
Me:cmd_my:Tell others how you are, genitive case:M
New:cmd_only:Specify number of new articles in current conference:T
(Goto) next conference:cmd_next_conf:Goto next conference with new articles:C
(Display) next follow-up:cmd_next_comment:Displays next follow-up in current conference:T
(Display) next article:cmd_next_text:Displays next new article in current conference:T
Only:cmd_only:Same as 'New':Y
Play (online games):cmd_bbslink:Calls games via the InterBBS-like service BBSLink:X
Post (article):cmd_post_text:Same as 'Write (article)':Y
Praise (article):cmd_like:Praise an article:T
(Read) previous new (article):cmd_read_last_text:Return to the most recently read new article:T
Reply:cmd_personal:Write a personal reply (mail) to article author:M
Restart:cmd_restart:Restart program and login again:O
(Report survey) result:cmd_survey_result:Report full survey result:T
Read (article):cmd_read_text:Same as 'Display (article)':Y
Restore unread:cmd_reclaim_unread:Immediately restore articles marked unread for the next session:T
Rot13:cmd_display_rot13:Read last text read with rot13 conversion:T
Shout:cmd_yell:Send message to all logged in users:M
Show license:cmd_licens:Show SklaffKOM license information:I
Skip branch:cmd_jump_over:Skip all articles in branch:T
Skip tree:cmd_jump_tree:Skip all articles in tree:T
Skip subject:cmd_jumpsub:Skip all articles with a certain subject:T
Skip user:cmd_jumpuser:Skip all articles written by a certain user:T
(Read) some (texts):cmd_readsome:Displays all unread articles in current conf:T
(Show) status:cmd_show_status:Show information about a user or a conference:I
Subscribe (to):cmd_subscribe:Subscribe to a conference:C
Subtract permission:cmd_sub_rights:Subtract permissions for a user in a conference:C
Tell:cmd_say:Send message to a logged in user:M
(Show) time:cmd_display_time:Show current time:I
Turn off (flag):cmd_off_flag:Turn off a flag:P
Turn on (flag):cmd_on_flag:Turn on a flag:P
Unread article:cmd_unread_text:Unread a specific article at logout-time:T
Unread branch:cmd_goto_text:Unread all articles below a specific article:T
Unread tree:cmd_unread_tree:Unread all articles in current tree:T
Unread subject:cmd_unreadsub:Unread all articles with a certain subject:T
Unpraise:cmd_unlike:Unpraise a text you have praised:T
Unsubscribe (to):cmd_unsubscribe:Unsubscribe to a conference:C
Upload (file):cmd_upload:Upload a file to current conference:F
Version:cmd_version:Show current SklaffKOM version:I
Wall:cmd_wall:Show the InterBBS-wall:X
Where (am I):cmd_where:Show current conference:I
Who (is online):cmd_who:Show logged in users:I
(Show) entire (text):cmd_whole_text:Show text with absolute date:T
Write (article):cmd_post_text:Write a new article in a conference:T
Yell:cmd_yell:Same as 'shout':Y
(Make) survey:cmd_post_survey:Make a survey in the current conference:T
Nethack:cmd_nethack:Play Nethack:X
Zork:cmd_zork:Play Zork 1,2 or 3:X

?:cmd_long_help:Same as 'Help':Y
+:cmd_next_conf:Same as 'Next conference':Y
-:cmd_display_commented:Same as 'Display followed-up':Y
